{
    "background_story": "Angelina's life was forever changed by a fortuitous encounter at a coffee shop. She had just graduated from art school and was struggling to make a name for herself in the competitive world of graphic design. One morning, while waiting in line, she accidentally bumped into a renowned designer, spilling coffee all over his portfolio. Apologetic, Angelina offered to buy him a new cup and help him reorganize his work. The designer, impressed by her kindness and creativity, offered her an internship on the spot. This chance meeting led to a dream job, and Angelina's talents were soon showcased in top design magazines. She never forgot the fortuitous encounter that launched her career and always remained grateful for the unexpected turn of events that brought her success.",
